{"sections":[{"slug":"仿射Grassmann空间","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"仿射Grassmann空间"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">仿射</span> Grassmann <span lang=\"zh\">空间</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"仿射 Grassmann 空间"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">仿射</span> Grassmann <span lang=\"zh\">空间是</span> Grassmann <span lang=\"zh\">空间的类比</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/环路群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">环路群</span>"}},{"Plain":" $LG$ <span lang=\"zh\">对</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/弧群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">弧群</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">极大抛物子群</span> $L^+G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的商</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">记号</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $k$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span> $R$, <span lang=\"zh\">记</span><strong></strong>"},{"Local":{"url":"/形式圆盘","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">形式圆盘</span>"}},{"Plain":" (formal disk) $D_R$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\operatorname{Spec}k[\\![t]\\!]\\hat\\times \\operatorname{Spec}R$, <span lang=\"zh\">形式去心圆盘</span> (formal punctured disk) $D_R^*$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\operatorname{Spec}k(\\!(t)\\!)\\hat\\times\\operatorname{Spec}R$.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">仿射</span> Grassmann <span lang=\"zh\">空间</span> $\\mathrm{Gr}_G$ <span lang=\"zh\">是如下对象的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/模空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">模空间</span>"}},{"Plain":": <span lang=\"zh\">形式圆盘</span> $D$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">主丛</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">带有去心圆盘上的平凡化</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">具体地说</span>, $\\mathrm{Gr}_G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的一个</span> $R$-<span lang=\"zh\">点是形式圆盘</span> $D_R$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的一个</span> $G$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/主丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">主丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">以及其在去心形式圆盘</span> $D_R^*$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的平凡化</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $G=\\mathrm{GL}_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的情形</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">上述对象等同于</span> $\\mathrm{GL}_n(k[\\![t]\\!])\\backslash\\mathrm{GL}_n(k(\\!(t)\\!))$ <span lang=\"zh\">的点</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">也即</span> $k(\\!(t)\\!)^n$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的格</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}